---
description: Required design workflow for production UI components
globs: ["packages/vue/src/**/*.vue", "docs/components/**/*.md"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Production components must pass the component gate in
`docs/agents/COMPONENT_WORKFLOW.md` (approved spec from
`docs/components/spec-template.md`, tests, docs, and a machine-readable
manifest). Do not start markup before the specification resolves public
behavior and accessibility.

